      "name": "Sneak Attack",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The caligni dancer deals <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d6</span> extra precision damage to Off-Guard creatures.</p></details>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
  ],
